f05c74df65cf"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["OllivierRicciCurvature",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the Ollivier-Ricci curvature of every edge, with the uniform \
measure on each neighbourhood"
